#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Setting the Cover Art <cover art; setting>`"
msgstr ":index:`设置封面图片 <cover art; setting>`"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:8
msgid "Depending on the option settings, you can change or confirm the cover art to save with a track or album."
msgstr "根据选项设置，您可以更改或确认要保存的封面图片，用于音轨或专辑。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:10
msgid "Once the release information has been downloaded, selecting an album or track in the right-hand pane will display both the original and new coverart for the selected item. You can easily replace the coverart image used for the selected item by dragging the image from the file browser and dropping it on the New Cover Art image."
msgstr ""
"下载发行信息后，在右侧窗格中选择专辑或音轨将显示选定项目的原始和新封面图片。"
"您可以通过从文件浏览器拖动图片并将其放置在“新封面图片”上，轻松替换选定项目使"
"用的封面图片。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:25
msgid "By right clicking on the image and selecting :menuselection:`\"Choose local file…\"` from the menu, you can choose a local file as the cover art."
msgstr ""
"通过右键单击图片并从菜单中选择 :menuselection:`\"选择本地文件…\"`，您可以选择"
"本地文件作为封面图片。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:27
msgid "The context menu also provides several additional options:"
msgstr "上下文菜单还提供了一些其他选项："

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:29
msgid ":menuselection:`Show more details…` opens the cover art information window showing detailed information about the selected artwork."
msgstr ":menuselection:`显示更多详情…`打开封面图片信息窗口，显示所选图片的详细信息。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:30
msgid ":menuselection:`Keep original cover art` restores the original artwork if new cover art has been downloaded or added."
msgstr ":menuselection:`保留原始封面图片`如果已下载或添加新封面图片，则恢复原始图片。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:31
msgid ":menuselection:`Choose local file…` allows selecting one or more image files from the local filesystem to use as cover art."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`选择本地文件…`允许从本地文件系统选择一个或多个图片文件用作封"
"面图片。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:32
msgid ":menuselection:`Add from URL…` downloads an image from a specified URL and adds it as cover art."
msgstr ":menuselection:`从 URL 添加…`从指定 URL 下载图片并将其作为封面图片添加。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:34
msgid "The menu also includes options controlling how newly added images are handled:"
msgstr "菜单还包括控制新添加图片如何处理的选项："

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:36
msgid ":menuselection:`Replace front cover art` replaces the existing front cover image."
msgstr ":menuselection:`替换正面封面图片`替换现有正面封面图片。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:37
msgid ":menuselection:`Append front cover art` adds the new image while keeping the existing artwork."
msgstr ":menuselection:`附加正面封面图片`添加新图片，同时保留现有作品。"

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:39
msgid "Selecting :menuselection:`\"Show more details\"` will bring up a new window as:"
msgstr "选择 :menuselection:`\"显示更多详情\"`将弹出一个新窗口，如下所示："

#: ../../usage/coverart.rst:54
msgid "Double-clicking an image will open the image file in the system default program for the image type."
msgstr "双击图片将在系统默认的图片类型程序中打开图片文件。"
